    "title": "Noodles & Company",
    "description": "Start earning Noodles Rewards! Download and sign up today, and you\u2019ll be on your way to get exclusive freebies, discounts, and offers.\r\n\r\nSKIP THE LINE\u00ae\r\nOrder from the app to go right to the front. No lines. No waiting. Plus, save orders to your favorites and reorder what you like with just a few taps. (Please, hold your applause. There\u2019s more.)\r\n\r\nSCAN TO EARN\r\nEarn rewards on everything from Wisconsin Mac & Cheese to cookies. Just open the app, scan your device, and enjoy rewards with the food you love. It\u2019s (much) easier than using chopsticks.\r\n\r\nGET DEALS & REWARDS\r\nBrowse available Deals and Rewards on the app, then redeem them at the restaurant or with your online order.\r\n\r\nFIND LOCATIONS\r\nHopefully, you\u2019re never too far from one of our restaurants. Use the app to find a Noodles nearby, or just follow the smell of pesto.\r\n\r\nDownload and get started today!\r\n\r\nThe Noodles Rewards program is available at participating locations only.",
